      'The full syllabus on Canvas is not mirrored. The videos do not state the homework weight, exam dates, office-hour times or the letter-grade cut-offs — check the current syllabus.',
      'Quiz “Class_1: Logistic and Introduction” and Homework W1 are not mirrored; the questions here are written from the videos, not taken from that quiz.',
